      "expected_behavior": "Agent should recall from memory: \"lighting fixture\"",
      "agent_response": "I don’t have a record of a specific lighting fixture choice for your modern room redecoration in your saved memories. I checked the items you’ve saved (redecorating is listed) but there’s no detail about which fixture you decided on.\n\nWould you like me to:\n- Search your emails/notes/calendar for that decision? (Tell me where to search — inbox, drafts, or calendar.)\n- Or help you pick one now? If you want suggestions for a modern look, quick options that work well:\n  - Minimal pendant (matte black or brushed brass) — good over a seating or desk area  \n  - Linear LED pendant — clean, great over a long table or console  \n  - Flush/semiflush LED fixture with a slim profile — for low ceilings  \n  - Recessed lights with dimmer — for even, unobtrusive illumination  \n  - Track lighting with adjustable heads — flexible accent/spot lighting  \n  - Sculptural modern chandelier — statement piece for a focal point  \n  - Slim arc floor lamp or wall sconces — layered ambient/reading light  \n  - LED strip accent lighting (cove or under-shelf) — subtle modern glow\n\nIf you want suggestions tailored to the room, tell me: room type (bedroom, living room, etc.), ceiling height, budget, finish preference, and whether you want smart/dimmable lighting — I’ll recommend one or two specific fixtures and can draft a shopping list or find purchase links. Which would you like?",
      "duration_s": 19.312,
      "passed": false,
      "success_check": {
