      "agent_response": "You picked bossa nova for the picnic — a great choice for a chill, relaxed vibe.\n\nQuick tips and ideas:\n- Artists/songs: Antônio Carlos Jobim (e.g., “The Girl from Ipanema”), João Gilberto, Stan Getz, Elis Regina, Astrud Gilberto.\n- Playlist length: 1–2 hours is usually enough for a picnic; mix instrumental and vocal tracks.\n- Ambience: keep volume low-to-moderate so conversation flows; place the speaker centrally but slightly protected from wind.\n- Pairings: soft string lights, light snacks (cheese, fruit, your s’mores!), and comfortable seating complement bossa nova well.\n\nWould you like me to build a 1-hour playlist (song list), find existing streaming playlists, or draft a short music schedule for the picnic?",
